   "function": "explanation",
   "scene_type": "zlx_board",
   "spoken": "In nineteen-oh-two, Bosch engineer Gottlob Honold presents high-voltage magneto ignition with a spark plug. Bosch files it for a patent the same year. Every spark plug today builds on that step. That idea is still in every engine today.",
